    "explanation": "Murky needs to scale for being impactful in team fights and that Murky's main strengths in the early game are gank resistance and waveclear. As such, Murky does great on late game Maps, especially if it possible to double soak, and does poorly on early game Maps.\n\nSince one of Murky's main strengths is the ability to quickly respawn from Spawn Egg, he is not a great choice on Maps where the Objective consists of items that need to be collected and are lost on death (Coins on Blackheart's Bay, Gems on Tomb of the Spider Queen, Warheads on Warhead Junction) because they require you to play safe."
