    {
      "name": "Slime Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Murky's Slime Build is designed to increase his survivability during team fights, especially if he happens to hit multiple enemies with Slime. This allows Murky to be quite annoying when he does not get killed quickly.\n\nIn order to stack Slime Time at Level 4, try to hit enemy Heroes with Slime when there are no enemy Minions to clear. The range from Black Lagoon at Level 7 makes it easier to hit enemy Heroes with Slime. Toxic Buildup at Level 16 and Making Inky at Level 20 increase your damage output.",
